softbf16-v100-toolkit
=====================

This repository contains two kinds of code:

1. vendor/softbf16/
   Unmodified source of Silvet's Soft-BF16-V100
   (https://github.com/S-i-l-v-e-t/Soft-BF16-V100), licensed AGPL-3.0.
   See vendor/softbf16/LICENSE.

2. shim/, tools/, examples/, install.ps1, uninstall.ps1
   Adapters and utilities written for this toolkit. They link against the
   kernel in (1) at runtime, so they are distributed under the same
   AGPL-3.0 license. See LICENSE.

No warranty. This software runs CUDA kernels on hardware the vendor no longer
supports for bf16/fp8 math; validate numerics for your own use case.

The integration approach in shim/fork_ops.py is derived from
https://github.com/S-i-l-v-e-t/ComfyUI-V100 (branch v100).
